{"id":14302,"date":"2024-12-05T16:45:21","date_gmt":"2024-12-05T21:45:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.hexagon.com\/?p=14302"},"modified":"2024-12-05T16:45:21","modified_gmt":"2024-12-05T21:45:21","slug":"infographic-digital-twin-unlocking-value","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.hexagon.com\/infographic-digital-twin-unlocking-value\/","title":{"rendered":"[Infographic] The digital twin effect: How leaders are unlocking value across industries"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>The digital twin advantage for modern businesses<\/h2>\n<p><em>In an era where data informs almost every strategic decision, <a href=\"https:\/\/hexagon.com\/resources\/insights\/digital-twin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">digital twins<\/a> \u2014 precise, dynamic digital replicas of physical assets or processes \u2014 are emerging as a powerful technology for business leaders who want to stay ahead. Digital twins allow companies to monitor, analyse and predict business performance in real-time to help leaders make better decisions.<\/em><\/p>\n<p>With insights that reveal both benefits and challenges, digital twins are proving to be more than a technology trend \u2014 they\u2019re reshaping business strategy.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/hexagon.com\/resources\/insights\/digital-twin\/report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-14304 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/blog.hexagon.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Hexagon_Digital-Twin-Report-Infographic-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Infographic on the value and impact of digital twins, featuring survey results, benefits, challenges, and AI usage\" width=\"565\" height=\"2560\" srcset=\"https:\/\/blog.hexagon.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Hexagon_Digital-Twin-Report-Infographic-scaled.jpg 565w, https:\/\/blog.hexagon.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Hexagon_Digital-Twin-Report-Infographic-66x300.jpg 66w, https:\/\/blog.hexagon.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Hexago